<title>USA: New York Giant Ike Hilliard now Converse endorser.</title>
<headline>New York Giant Ike Hilliard now Converse endorser.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH READING, Mass. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Giants rookie wide reciever, Ike Hilliard, signed a multi-year endorsement contract with Converse Inc , the athletic footwear maker said Friday.</p>
<p>Hilliard, the Giants' first round 1997 National Football League draft pick, will serve as the spokesperson and an endorser for its cross-training line of footwear.  Terms of the agreement were not disclosed, the company said in a statement.</p>
